Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.29,0:01:04.83,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(244,398)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.87,0:01:04.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又来到那个时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.87,0:01:04.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's coming up on that time again
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.07,0:01:06.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子  点火吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.07,0:01:06.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, boy, fire her up
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.25,0:01:08.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,荣幸之至  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.25,0:01:08.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With pleasure, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.30,0:01:18.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就爱工作里的这一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:18.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love this part of the job
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.98,0:01:20.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了奶酪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.98,0:01:20.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't forget the cheese
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.76,0:01:22.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这部分也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:22.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This part ain't bad either
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.42,0:01:30.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看着不错  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.42,0:01:30.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks good, kiddo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想主持这光荣的仪式吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want to do the honors?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.36,0:01:34.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你意思该不会是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:34.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't mean
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.22,0:01:36.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就那意思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.22,0:01:36.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.62,0:01:37.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感谢蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.62,0:01:37.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.75,0:01:38.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.75,0:01:38.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.45,0:01:40.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我倍感荣耀  倍感光荣能来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:40.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It is both an honor and a privilege that I shall--
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.66,0:01:42.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在扯什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:42.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you going on about?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.09,0:01:43.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我每天都让你翻牌子的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.09,0:01:43.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I let you turn the sign every day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:46.96,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,450)}开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:49.54,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(830,746)}礼仪手套
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.13,0:01:52.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我特此戴上礼仪白手套
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:52.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As I don the ceremonial white gloves
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.42,0:01:54.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,延续了这一永恒的轮回
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.42,0:01:54.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I continue the eternal cycle
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.15,0:01:56.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在此认定蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.15,0:01:56.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and now deem the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.17,0:01:56.55,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(730,764)}关
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.55,0:01:58.34,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(730,764)}开
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.81,0:01:57.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开门营业
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.81,0:01:57.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Open
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.71,0:02:00.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,贵客们  涌过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.71,0:02:00.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrons, spring forth
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.39,0:02:02.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王恭迎你们落座
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:02.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Krusty Krab will now seat you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.42,0:02:06.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们这群旱鸭子  快拿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:06.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, you landlubbers, get the--
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.05,0:02:09.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.05,0:02:09.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Neptune's jewels
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.19,0:02:10.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我客人哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:10.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are me customers?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.65,0:02:12.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡本来差一点点就能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:12.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And just when the Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.30,0:02:13.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,喜提三倍白金销量了的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.30,0:02:13.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,was about to go triple platinum
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.30,0:02:13.90,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 白金销量：指唱片或专辑销量\N达到行业认证的白金标准 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.09,0:02:14.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.09,0:02:14.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.06,0:02:15.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.06,0:02:15.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.35,0:02:17.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.35,0:02:17.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.05,0:02:19.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没必要大吼大叫  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.05,0:02:19.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No need to shout, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.42,0:02:20.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他就在这
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:20.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's right here
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.48,0:02:22.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,偷偷看他最喜欢的肥皂剧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:22.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,secretly watching his favorite soap
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.32,0:02:23.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,剧名叫潮起潮落
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:23.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As The Tide Turns
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.82,0:02:25.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别吵  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.82,0:02:25.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shut it, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.12,0:02:26.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吉尔就快公开他的秘密了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:26.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gil is about to reveal his secret
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.94,0:02:28.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:28.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.40,0:02:31.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些小朋友  是我的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:31.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Them guppies, them's my children
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.17,0:02:32.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:32.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.21,0:02:34.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怕你们两个没发现就再提醒下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.21,0:02:34.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In case you two haven't noticed
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.00,0:02:36.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们没客人了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:36.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we got no customers
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.72,0:02:37.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想把他们重新引回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.72,0:02:37.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And we're not gonna get them back
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.94,0:02:40.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个懒鬼就别成天闲坐着看电视
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.94,0:02:40.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if you two lazy Susans sit around the TV all day
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.92,0:02:42.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,喔喔喔  好好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:42.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cock-a-doodle-yum
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.62,0:02:44.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,起床咯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.62,0:02:44.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.72,0:02:47.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,过来全海底最棒的餐厅咯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:47.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the best restaurant in the sea
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.12,0:02:51.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁竟敢声称自己是全海底最棒的餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:49.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who dares lay claim
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:51.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to the title "best restaurant in the sea"?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海底鸡小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The sea chicken shack
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.29,0:02:55.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海底鸡先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.29,0:02:55.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say, Mr. Sea chicken
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.93,0:02:58.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那带劲的海底鸡三明治是什么味道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.93,0:02:58.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how's the flavor of that zesty sea chicken sandwich?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.30,0:03:01.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吃到不容置鸡嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.30,0:03:01.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's im-peck-able
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.78,0:03:04.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来我的海底鸡小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:04.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So come on down to my sea chicken shack
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.50,0:03:06.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了带小朋友来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:06.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and don't forget the kids
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.15,0:03:10.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.15,0:03:10.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Blimey
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.16,0:03:13.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,第一次听说这位海底鸡先生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:13.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is the first I've heard of this Mr. Sea chicken
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.79,0:03:15.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我垄断地位没了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:15.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There goes me monopoly
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.42,0:03:19.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可他是怎么这么快就拐走我老主顾的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:19.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But how did he lure me loyal customers away so fast?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.78,0:03:23.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  我要你去海底鸡小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:21.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, I need you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.59,0:03:23.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to head over to the sea chicken shack
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.47,0:03:24.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看是什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:24.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and see what's cooking
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.87,0:03:27.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要我去卧底吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.87,0:03:27.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want me to go undercover?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.56,0:03:29.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没那必要  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:29.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That won't be necessary, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.82,0:03:30.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只需要看看四周
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.82,0:03:30.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just look around
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.90,0:03:32.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,摸清他是怎么把客人拉拢过去的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.90,0:03:32.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,see how he's roping in all these customers
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.70,0:03:33.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明白  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.70,0:03:33.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Understood, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.72,0:03:38.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,觉得我新买的腋窝间谍摄像头怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.72,0:03:38.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How do you like my new armpit spy cam, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.01,0:03:41.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  用不着当间谍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.01,0:03:41.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, I don't need a spy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.69,0:03:42.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.69,0:03:42.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And check this out
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.72,0:03:44.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,特制间谍圆珠笔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:44.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a special spy pen
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.66,0:03:46.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,样子像一根普通圆珠笔  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:46.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks just like a regular pen, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.20,0:03:48.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看看看看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:48.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See, see, see, see, see?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.47,0:03:48.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.47,0:03:48.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.75,0:03:49.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就一根笔对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:49.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just a pen, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.51,0:03:49.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.51,0:03:49.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.31,0:03:50.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:50.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.82,0:03:52.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你就错了  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.82,0:03:52.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you'd be mistaken, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.40,0:03:57.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为这根圆珠笔  也是根铅笔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.40,0:03:57.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because this pen is also a pencil
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.02,0:04:01.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,卧底间谍装备都不错吧  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:01.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pretty sweet undercover spy stuff, huh, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.01,0:04:04.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子  不要闹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.01,0:04:04.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boy, stop this nonsense
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.15,0:04:05.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.15,0:04:05.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.00,0:04:06.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要啥间谍圆珠笔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:06.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who needs a spy pen
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.48,0:04:09.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明明自己都是个卧底术大师了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:09.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when you are a master in the undercover arts?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.80,0:04:11.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要融入普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:11.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I blend in with the common man
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.55,0:04:14.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后神不知鬼不觉地离开
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.55,0:04:14.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then like a whisper, I am gone
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.81,0:04:18.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黄色洗碗布呼叫红老大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.81,0:04:18.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yellow scrubber to big red
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.22,0:04:19.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请回答  红老大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.22,0:04:19.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,come in, big red
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.02,0:04:21.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把你看到的告诉我就行  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:21.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just tell me what you see, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.53,0:04:22.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.53,0:04:22.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am inside
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.59,0:04:24.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,重复  我进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:24.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Repeat, I am inside
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.53,0:04:25.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,目前没什么好报告的状况
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:25.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing of interest to report so far
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.95,0:04:27.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说实话  这里有点破烂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:27.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's kind of dumpy
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.62,0:04:29.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,客人安全措施
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:29.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And customer safety
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.46,0:04:31.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有点松懈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.46,0:04:31.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A little lax
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.57,0:04:33.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且里面还很臭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.57,0:04:33.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And it smells in here
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.87,0:04:36.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,臭得像跑完马拉松洗海藻浴的金枪鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:36.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,like a tuna bathed in algae after running a marathon
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.89,0:04:39.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在健身也犯罪了是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.89,0:04:39.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So it's a crime now to exercise?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.00,0:04:40.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,食物怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.00,0:04:40.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What about the food?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.50,0:04:42.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我现已渗透进队伍里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:42.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have infiltrated the line right now
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.68,0:04:45.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,待取得样品再回报
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:45.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I'll report back once I have obtained sample
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:54.52,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(774,792)}菜单
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.92,0:04:47.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.92,0:04:47.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.04,0:04:49.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请来一份你们这边最好的三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:49.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll have one of your finest sandwiches, please
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.22,0:04:51.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恐怕不行  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:51.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't do that, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.45,0:04:54.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请参阅我们的着装规定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:54.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, refer to our policy regarding dress
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.85,0:04:57.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,戴头带等于不提供服务
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:57.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Headbands equal no service"
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.40,0:04:59.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:04:59.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Barnacles
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.19,0:05:00.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的伪装唯一存在的弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.19,0:05:00.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My disguise's only weakness
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.41,0:05:02.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求救  红老大
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:02.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mayday, big red
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.65,0:05:04.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,未取得接触
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.65,0:05:04.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Contact has not been established
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.55,0:05:05.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,任务中止
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.55,0:05:05.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mission abort
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.35,0:05:06.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,任务中止
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:06.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mission abort
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.16,0:05:08.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黄色洗碗布呼叫红老大
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:08.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yellow scrubber to big red
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.48,0:05:09.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我无法取得任何情报
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:09.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was not able to obtain any intel
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.15,0:05:12.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别讲间谍话了  直接告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.15,0:05:12.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cut the spy lingo and just tell me
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.78,0:05:16.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海底鸡小屋有什么厉害的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.78,0:05:14.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is there anything remarkable
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:16.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,about the sea chicken shack?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.53,0:05:18.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,除了故意装修得很破烂外  基本没
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.53,0:05:18.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Other than the faux dilapidation, not really
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.50,0:05:20.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你说的根本就是个垃圾场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:20.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What you're describing is an absolute dump
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.19,0:05:23.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有什么独特的或者有趣的配套设施
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.19,0:05:23.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are there any unique or interesting amenities
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.62,0:05:26.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会引走我客人的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.62,0:05:26.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that might attract me customers in any way?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.61,0:05:27.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.61,0:05:27.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.44,0:05:29.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的大堡礁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.44,0:05:29.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great barrier reef
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.05,0:05:29.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.05,0:05:29.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is it, lad?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.89,0:05:30.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看到啥了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:30.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.43,0:05:32.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我看到一座巨大雕像
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:32.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I see a giant statue
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.63,0:05:34.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,雕刻了海底鸡先生的光辉形象
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.63,0:05:34.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,depicting Mr. Sea chicken in all his glory
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.98,0:05:35.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,雕像吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:35.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A statue?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.92,0:05:38.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,雕像怎么会偷得走我客人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.92,0:05:38.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How does a statue steal me customers?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.12,0:05:39.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:39.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.19,0:05:40.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:40.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.40,0:05:47.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:47.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.52,0:05:52.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海底鸡先生  你这疯狂的骗子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:52.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sea chicken, you mad trickster, you
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.15,0:05:53.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,迎合小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.15,0:05:53.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cater to the kids
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.90,0:05:56.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,家长就得跟过去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.90,0:05:56.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and the parents will follow
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.79,0:05:58.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子们  时间有限
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.79,0:05:58.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boys, we don't have much time
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我就长话短说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna make this short and sweet
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.57,0:06:01.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要一位艺术家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.57,0:06:01.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need an artist
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.80,0:06:03.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要有眼界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:03.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,someone with a vision
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.75,0:06:04.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.75,0:06:04.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.82,0:06:07.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们当中某位极具天赋的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:07.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Someone among us with a big talent
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.27,0:06:08.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他说的就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.27,0:06:08.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's talking about me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.94,0:06:14.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能给我雕刻出光辉雄伟形象的雕塑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.94,0:06:10.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Someone to create
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:14.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a glorious, towering statue of my likeness
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.10,0:06:17.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们知道这附近谁身上有艺术细胞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:16.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You guys know anyone around here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:17.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with an artistic bone in their body?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.27,0:06:23.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.27,0:06:23.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.88,0:06:24.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:24.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.67,0:06:25.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.67,0:06:25.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.09,0:06:25.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,猜猜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:25.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Guess
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.80,0:06:27.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,龙虾拉里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:27.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry the lobster?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.05,0:06:28.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.05,0:06:28.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.74,0:06:29.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老头简金斯吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.74,0:06:29.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Old man Jenkins?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.91,0:06:30.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.91,0:06:30.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.82,0:06:32.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,独牙萨莉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.82,0:06:32.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One-tooth Sally?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.92,0:06:33.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:33.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.71,0:06:34.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我妈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.71,0:06:34.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My mom?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.50,0:06:35.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:35.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.57,0:06:37.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,岂有此理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.57,0:06:37.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For the love of all things briny
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.80,0:06:39.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:39.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.80,0:06:40.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,答对了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:40.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Correct
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.60,0:06:43.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:43.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.80,0:06:47.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你会搞那个什么乱七八糟的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:47.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You do dabble in the doodling doodle-doo
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.55,0:06:48.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给想听的人说几句
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:48.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For those who care
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.92,0:06:52.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我完全就是个艺术天才
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:52.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am nothing short of an artistic genius
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.25,0:06:52.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,同意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.25,0:06:52.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Word
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.92,0:06:57.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可惜我的天分不允许我制作商业作品
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:54.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that precludes me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.89,0:06:57.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from doing any commercial pieces
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.68,0:06:58.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:58.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good-bye
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.32,0:06:59.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.32,0:06:59.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, now
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.30,0:07:01.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等  章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.30,0:07:01.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Mr. Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.00,0:07:03.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟你没那么多差别
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:03.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You and I aren't that different from each other
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.44,0:07:05.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的作品跟我的产品都是品
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:05.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We both make product
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.49,0:07:08.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你意思是说蟹黄堡算艺术吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.49,0:07:08.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting that Krabby Patties are art?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.77,0:07:09.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.77,0:07:09.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.68,0:07:11.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  你知不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.68,0:07:11.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, do you have any idea
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.78,0:07:14.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,每天会有多少人来蟹堡王吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.78,0:07:14.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how many people come to the Krusty Krab every day?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.02,0:07:15.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.02,0:07:15.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.67,0:07:16.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,十二吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:16.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,12
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.37,0:07:19.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那看你艺术品的比昨天多了十二个人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:19.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that's 12 more seeing your art than yesterday
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.10,0:07:22.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:22.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.82,0:07:24.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做就做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:24.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll do it
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.59,0:07:28.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但这艺术得由我全权负责
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.59,0:07:28.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I will need complete artistic control
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.28,0:07:29.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:29.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got it
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.00,0:07:30.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要赶在明天营业前做完就行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:30.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Long as it's done by opening tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.85,0:07:31.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  明
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.85,0:07:31.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, tom--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.38,0:07:32.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.38,0:07:32.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.02,0:07:33.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都说定了的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.02,0:07:33.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As advertised
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.28,0:07:36.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,旷世巨作可不能一夜之间完成
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:36.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't make a work for the ages overnight
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.15,0:07:38.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,艺术可绝不听从时间的摆布
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:38.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Art does not march to a ticking clock
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.81,0:07:42.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,艺术得等到臻于完美了才会出现
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.81,0:07:42.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Art shall come when art is good and ready, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.88,0:07:46.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想要公众体验到你的文化底蕴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.88,0:07:43.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you want the public
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:46.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to experience your cultural import
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.37,0:07:48.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就在早上八点前做好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.37,0:07:48.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,get it ready by 8:00 AM
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.79,0:07:51.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要个助手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.79,0:07:51.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll need an assistant
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.15,0:07:52.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,助手给你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.15,0:07:52.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you go
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.36,0:07:54.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:54.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.40,0:07:57.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要你做的第一件事  助手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.40,0:07:57.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The first thing I need you to do, assistant
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.16,0:07:59.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是给我一块巨石
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:07:59.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is get me a giant stone
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.27,0:08:01.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我雕刻出这一旷世巨作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:01.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so that I may sculpt this masterpiece
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.72,0:08:03.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,乐意为大师效劳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:03.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything for the artiste
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.60,0:08:04.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不准磨磨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.60,0:08:04.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And don't dilly--
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.77,0:08:06.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蹭蹭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.77,0:08:06.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,dally
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.84,0:08:08.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这石头不错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:08.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice rock
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.72,0:08:09.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.72,0:08:09.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.42,0:08:11.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不敢相信没人在用它
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:11.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't believe no one was using it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:12.72,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(434,186)}博物馆
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.47,0:08:16.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要发财了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:16.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be rich
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.18,0:08:17.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要出名了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:17.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna famous
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.80,0:08:20.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要当上章鱼哥的取巨石助手了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.80,0:08:20.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna Squidward's assistant giant rock fetcher
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.20,0:08:24.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好塑成雕像  永垂不朽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:24.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Prepare to be immortalized in stone
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.45,0:08:28.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这是在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.45,0:08:28.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.92,0:08:29.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:29.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.47,0:08:31.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.47,0:08:31.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,shy
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.69,0:08:33.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是在要你摆姿势
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.69,0:08:33.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am posing you
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.46,0:08:35.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你难道以为雕塑会自己雕自己吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.46,0:08:35.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you think this sculpture was going to make itself?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.80,0:08:38.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不想要雕塑给你赚大钱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:38.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you want the money this statue's gonna bring in?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.55,0:08:40.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.55,0:08:40.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.36,0:08:40.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.36,0:08:40.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.76,0:08:41.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.76,0:08:41.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or this?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.62,0:08:42.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:42.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.00,0:08:42.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:42.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or this?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.76,0:08:43.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:43.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.31,0:08:43.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:43.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or this?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.95,0:08:44.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.95,0:08:44.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.78,0:08:45.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.78,0:08:45.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.75,0:08:50.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,保持那个姿势
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:50.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold that pose
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.45,0:08:53.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一块肌肉都别动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.45,0:08:53.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't move a muscle
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.42,0:08:56.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得保持这姿势多久
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.42,0:08:56.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How long am I gonna have to stay like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.59,0:08:58.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要多久就多久
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.59,0:08:58.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As long as it takes
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.53,0:09:56.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.53,0:09:56.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.56,0:09:58.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我快累死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.56,0:09:58.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm about to give out
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.13,0:09:59.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:09:59.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All done
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.41,0:10:03.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:03.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.07,0:10:04.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.07,0:10:04.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.95,0:10:06.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,墨镜戴好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:06.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Make sure you wear sunglasses
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.85,0:10:09.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然就会被我的天分闪瞎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:09.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or you may be blinded by my genius
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.54,0:10:10.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:10.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.47,0:10:11.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.47,0:10:11.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just show me
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.55,0:10:12.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.55,0:10:12.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Voila
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.45,0:10:23.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是个什么玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.45,0:10:23.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to be?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.04,0:10:26.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是个旷世巨作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:26.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is a masterpiece
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.48,0:10:28.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我肚子上又没有嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:28.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't have a mouth in my stomach
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.65,0:10:33.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它代表着消费主义的血盆大口
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:33.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It represents the gaping, mashing maw of consumerism
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.00,0:10:36.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以及它在我们心中造就的无尽深渊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:36.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and the endless cavern it creates within us all
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.31,0:10:38.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我称它为  压迫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.31,0:10:38.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I call it oppression
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.15,0:10:40.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,随便你什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.15,0:10:40.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whatever that means
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.58,0:10:42.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但那东西给小孩子玩安全吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:42.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But is it safe for kids to play on?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.62,0:10:45.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是艺术  不是秋千
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:45.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is art, not a swing set
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.04,0:10:48.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得先来个试运营才可以给大众使用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:46.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, we should do a dry run
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:48.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,before we let the general public use it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.77,0:10:49.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.77,0:10:49.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.40,0:10:51.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,报到  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:51.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Reporting for duty, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.05,0:10:55.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要你嬉闹玩耍这个啥玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:53.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need you to frolic and play
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:55.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on this here doohickey thing
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.62,0:10:57.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这不是啥玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.62,0:10:57.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It is not a doohickey
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.98,0:10:59.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.98,0:10:59.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's art
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.38,0:11:01.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,收到  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.38,0:11:01.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I read you loud and clear, cap'n
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.65,0:11:03.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,清楚明白
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.65,0:11:03.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Loud and clear
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.41,0:11:13.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.41,0:11:13.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is heavy
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.29,0:11:15.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.29,0:11:15.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.40,0:11:18.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能让小孩子玩那种  那种武器
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:18.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't let children play on that-that-that weapon
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.95,0:11:20.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会被告到裤衩都不剩的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.95,0:11:20.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get my pants sued off
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.70,0:11:21.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:21.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.52,0:11:23.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要艺术  我就给你艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:23.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You wanted a piece of art, and that's what you got
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.54,0:11:26.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实很艺
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.54,0:11:26.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a piece, all right
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.22,0:11:27.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是艺坨垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.22,0:11:27.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A piece of junk
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.83,0:11:30.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  我可以提个点子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:30.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, if I may be allowed to float an idea?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.61,0:11:31.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听到什么声音没
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.61,0:11:31.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you hear something?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.55,0:11:38.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得保持这样子多久
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.55,0:11:38.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How long do I have to stay like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.46,0:11:41.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想维持蟹黄堡销量  就继续摆着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:41.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As long as you keep wanting to sell this many patties
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.55,0:11:45.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得你样子真不错  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.55,0:11:45.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think you look really good, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.76,0:11:48.27,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(388,868)}金
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.05,0:11:47.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.05,0:11:47.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're golden
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.05,0:11:47.30,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(686,920)}金
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:53.65,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,蛾螺入侵记
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:56.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(239.33,446)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:56.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:58.53,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:58.53,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(391.575,416)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:58.53,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(509.742,656)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.69,0:12:01.15,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.69,0:12:01.15,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.19,0:12:05.24,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(406,610)}水母田
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.46,0:12:54.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说是不是咱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:54.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you think we
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.28,0:12:56.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们撞地撞得太用力  引发了地震
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:56.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we caused an earthquake by hitting the ground too hard?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.55,0:12:57.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:57.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.81,0:12:59.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也有可能是它们引发的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.81,0:12:59.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or maybe it's them
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.63,0:13:04.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以前从来没在附近见过它们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.63,0:13:04.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never seen those guys around before
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.98,0:13:21.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,浑身都沾满了黏液
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.98,0:13:21.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're all covered in slime
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.97,0:13:23.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:23.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.05,0:13:25.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟我是个海绵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.05,0:13:25.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am a sponge after all
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.57,0:13:30.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:30.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold still
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.93,0:13:36.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在漏水
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:36.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're leaking
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.98,0:13:38.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  能回避吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:38.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, do you mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.95,0:13:40.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得把自己拧干净
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.95,0:13:40.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got to wring myself out
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.00,0:13:41.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不必多说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:41.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say no more
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.40,0:13:51.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得去警告裤头村要小心这些生物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.40,0:13:51.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We have to warn Bikini Bottom about those creatures
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.23,0:13:55.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蛾螺来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.23,0:13:55.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whelks
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.70,0:14:31.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:31.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.90,0:14:33.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.90,0:14:33.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.61,0:14:39.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:39.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are those things?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.38,0:14:40.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海蛾螺
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:40.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sea whelks
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.63,0:14:42.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是一种有害的海蜗牛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:42.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A pernicious form of sea snail
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.62,0:14:45.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,入侵了裤头村  还发动了袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.62,0:14:45.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,have invaded Bikini Bottom and are on the attack
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:49.57,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1046,608)}巨型海蛾螺\N入侵
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.42,0:14:47.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吞掉了无辜的居民们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.42,0:14:47.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,devouring innocent citizens
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.11,0:14:49.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,害全城都沾满了紫色黏液
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.11,0:14:49.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and covering the city with purple slime
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.92,0:14:55.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,幸好裤头村新闻编辑室非常安全
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:55.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Luckily, the Bikini Bottom newsroom is perfectly safe
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.05,0:14:57.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村新闻  播送完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.05,0:14:57.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is Bikini Bottom news signing off
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.16,0:14:57.58,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(668,926)}请稍候
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.85,0:14:58.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蛾螺啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.85,0:14:58.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whelks
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.87,0:15:01.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不怕什么笨笨的老海蜗牛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.87,0:15:01.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of some goofy old sea snail
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.45,0:15:05.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.45,0:15:05.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.00,0:15:05.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:05.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.63,0:15:07.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗有时会有点吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:07.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary can be a little creepy
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.96,0:15:09.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不怕它们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:09.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not afraid of them
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.90,0:15:10.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:10.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch this
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.64,0:15:27.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:27.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.42,0:15:50.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.42,0:15:50.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How'd it go?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.18,0:15:50.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没空聊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:50.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can't talk
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.77,0:15:51.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.77,0:15:51.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Running
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:55.72,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,226)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.01,0:15:58.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放我们进去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.01,0:15:58.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let us in
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.96,0:16:00.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托章鱼哥  放我们进去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.96,0:16:00.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, please, let us in
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.51,0:16:05.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.51,0:16:05.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.37,0:16:18.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  有群饥饿的巨型海蛾螺来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.37,0:16:18.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, ravenous, giant sea whelks are coming
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.12,0:16:20.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它们长得有点像小蜗  又不太像
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.12,0:16:20.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They kind of look like Gary but not really
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.27,0:16:21.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还会吐紫色的黏液
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:21.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and they spit purple slime
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.96,0:16:23.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还在到处吃人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:23.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and they're eating everyone
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.51,0:16:24.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还想吃我跟派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.51,0:16:24.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They tried to eat me and Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.63,0:16:25.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我们跑啊跑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:25.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but we ran and ran
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.54,0:16:26.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.54,0:16:26.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And then we got away
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.22,0:16:28.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,饥饿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:28.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ravenous
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.63,0:16:29.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就是饿肚子了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.63,0:16:29.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That means hungry
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.84,0:16:35.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:35.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.52,0:16:37.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来买蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:37.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get your Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尝尝热乎乎的蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try a nice, hot Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.98,0:16:41.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一个三块九毛九
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:41.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,only $3.99 each
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.20,0:16:47.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总共五十四块九毛五
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:47.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That'll be $54.95
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.47,0:16:51.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不喜欢蟹黄堡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:51.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't care for Krabby Patties, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.05,0:16:54.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许菜单上还有其他你们喜欢的菜品
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.05,0:16:54.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe there's something else on the menu you'd like
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.68,0:17:11.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵  海绵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.68,0:17:11.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spo, Spo--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.81,0:17:13.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  说人话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.81,0:17:13.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, use your words
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.91,0:17:17.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼  章鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:17.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squid, Squid--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.07,0:17:19.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  好大一只老妈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.07,0:17:19.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's one big mama
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.05,0:17:30.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:30.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.21,0:17:36.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这只螺看起来品味挺独特的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:36.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You seem like a mollusk of discerning tastes
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.58,0:17:38.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以为你推荐一份海草薯条配菜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:38.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Could I interest you in a side of kelp fries?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.37,0:17:43.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不在菜单上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.37,0:17:43.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not on the menu
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.68,0:17:47.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  它吞掉了蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:47.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, it swallowed Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.08,0:17:49.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,与我何干
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.08,0:17:49.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And this affects me how?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.92,0:17:55.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:55.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.42,0:18:10.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:10.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.47,0:18:11.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪珊迪珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.47,0:18:11.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy, Sandy, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.26,0:18:12.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放我们进去  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:12.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let us in, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.29,0:18:13.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:13.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.46,0:18:14.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放我们进去  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:14.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let us in, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.50,0:18:26.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.50,0:18:26.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.91,0:18:29.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪  放我们进去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.91,0:18:29.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy, let us in
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.63,0:18:33.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么确定你们不是伪装起来的蛾螺
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.63,0:18:33.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How can I be sure you're not whelks in disguise?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.63,0:18:34.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们不是蛾螺
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.63,0:18:34.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're not whelks
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.66,0:18:35.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:35.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We promise
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.52,0:18:36.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放我们进去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:36.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let us in
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.92,0:18:41.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你妈婚前姓什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:41.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's your mother's maiden name?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.78,0:18:42.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可爱泡泡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:42.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bubblebottom
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.40,0:18:44.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你叫什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.40,0:18:44.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, what's your first name?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.01,0:18:46.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是脑筋急转弯吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:46.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is this a trick question?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.12,0:18:48.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.12,0:18:48.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're in
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.17,0:18:56.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:56.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.30,0:18:58.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也许知道那个问题的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:58.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I may know the answer to that question
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.30,0:19:00.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是要正常的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:19:00.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you want the regular answer
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.15,0:19:02.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是充满打斗动作的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.15,0:19:02.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or the action-packed answer?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.45,0:19:04.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,充满打斗动作的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.45,0:19:04.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Action-packed, please
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.41,0:19:05.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.41,0:19:05.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.83,0:19:08.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要取一份它们黏液的样本
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.83,0:19:08.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need to get a sample of their slime
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.59,0:19:12.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果我能分析它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.59,0:19:12.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I can analyze it
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.93,0:19:16.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许就可以推断出
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.93,0:19:16.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I may be able to deduce
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.44,0:19:21.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它们攻击行为的成因
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:21.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The cause of their aggressive behavior
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.84,0:19:23.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后也许就能阻止它们了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.84,0:19:23.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And maybe we can stop them
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.64,0:19:29.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:29.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.48,0:19:59.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.48,0:19:59.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.29,0:20:00.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.29,0:20:00.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Follow me
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.32,0:20:04.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来要交代在这了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.32,0:20:04.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess this is it, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.02,0:20:05.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们先跑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:05.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You guys go
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.82,0:20:07.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我拖住它们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.82,0:20:07.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll hold them off
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.95,0:20:09.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是我失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.95,0:20:09.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And if I fail
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.37,0:20:12.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,至少我的牺牲能推迟那躲不掉的结局
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:12.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,at least my sacrifice will delay the inenimable
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.47,0:20:14.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不能让你那么做  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.47,0:20:14.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't let you do that, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.30,0:20:15.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我来献出生命吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:15.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one to lay down my life
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.65,0:20:16.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  那你去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.65,0:20:16.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, you go
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.32,0:20:17.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:17.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.99,0:20:18.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.99,0:20:18.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll go
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.77,0:20:20.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蛾螺似乎并不会吃陆地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.77,0:20:20.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The whelks don't seem to be after land--
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.03,0:20:21.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,生物
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.03,0:20:21.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,critters
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.51,0:20:44.05,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(978,698)}裤头村
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.02,0:20:46.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  快看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:46.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, look at that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.59,0:20:48.97,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(546,302)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.77,0:20:48.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.77,0:20:48.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.20,0:20:54.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大伙都在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.20,0:20:54.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The gang's all here
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.94,0:20:55.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打烊了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.94,0:20:55.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're closed
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.56,0:20:56.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天再来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:20:56.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come back tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.95,0:21:01.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  眼角膜借我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.95,0:21:01.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob, lend me your corneas a second
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.82,0:21:02.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你也一样  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:02.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You too, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.65,0:21:04.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.65,0:21:04.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.14,0:21:13.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:13.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, golly
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.88,0:21:15.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怪不得它们都那么暴躁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:15.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No wonder they're all grumpy
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.68,0:21:17.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些蛾螺体内全是细菌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.68,0:21:17.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Them whelks are full of germs
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.32,0:21:19.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,简直病得严重得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.32,0:21:19.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, they're sicker than a bull with the squirrel pox
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.02,0:21:21.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.02,0:21:21.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know just what to do
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.67,0:21:23.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟我先前得过肥皂泡病
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.67,0:21:23.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After all, I've had the suds
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.97,0:21:26.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要把蛾螺的鼻涕吸收干净
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.97,0:21:26.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just have to absorb the whelk snot
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.20,0:21:27.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它们就会恢复正常了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:27.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and they'll return to normal
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.83,0:21:48.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把你们剩下的都清理干净吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.83,0:21:48.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now let's get the rest of you cleaned up
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.17,0:22:06.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.17,0:22:06.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cute
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.31,0:22:20.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.31,0:22:20.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Scuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.57,0:22:22.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你健康
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.57,0:22:22.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gesundheit
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.65,0:22:24.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你做到了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.65,0:22:24.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You did it, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.85,0:22:30.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以这些东西发疯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.85,0:22:30.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So these things went crazy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.84,0:22:32.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是因为得了小感冒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.84,0:22:32.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just because they had the sniffles?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.50,0:22:42.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,喷进他眼睛里了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.50,0:22:42.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's in his eye
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.41,0:22:47.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.41,0:22:47.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's hilarious
